<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Stag Yellow, 1969</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes the the pro-Soviet military dictatorship of General Juan Velasco that seized control of Peru in the late 1960s&amp;nbsp;was not only unfriendly to the United States, but actively hostile.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Along with building stronger relations with the Soviet Union,&amp;nbsp;Peru has seized&amp;nbsp;and sometimes even&amp;nbsp;fired on American fishing boats it claimed were violating its territorial waters.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Last week,&amp;nbsp;Peru fired on and&amp;nbsp;sank an American trawler.&amp;nbsp; Six Americans were killed in the attack.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;The President is outraged by&amp;nbsp;Peru's actions&amp;nbsp;and has decided that a punitive&amp;nbsp;strike is necessary. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
